<span id="S4.T3.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Human Instruction: Perception result
<br class="ltx_break">Camera Image: Perception result
<br class="ltx_break">LiDAR Image: Perception result</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T3.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T3.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T3.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="S4.T3.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Brain</span>
</span></td>
