<p id="S5.F7.4" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S5.F7.4.1" class="ltx_text"></span></p></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="S5.F7.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Scenario 1 Evaluation Results: Performance comparison between Baseline and our approach across multiple metrics in both attack-free and attack scenarios. The analysis includes cost metrics (steps, tokens, distance), Mission Oriented Exploration Rate (MOER), Attack Detection Rate (ADR), and Target Loss Rate (TLR) across different environmental settings (OF, SO, DO, MO). </span></figcaption>
</figure>
